==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 500 seconds<sup>15,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start by letting money build up, then hit the base and let the other Razorback get close to yours. Freeze him, then either:

*Kill him as fast as possible. Follow by summoning [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Heavy]] to get Othom off your base and it is smooth sailing from there.
*Spam meatshields and Bombers, then try to snipe Othom with [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance attackers]] like [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] and/or similar Ubers to kill him before taking care of Razorback.

==Trivia==
*The Japanese name of this stage, Tropical Choco-Banana Garden, refers to chocolate-covered bananas, a popular snack in Southeast Asia.

